# Declension: en.wiktionary.org, entry “घंटा” (masculine ā-stem: घंटा / घंटे / घंटों).  A noun counted by a
# numeral stands in the OBLIQUE case, so the oblique forms are unit
# surfaces in their own right.
# CLDR 47 writes the counted form oblique in its own patterns (“{0} घंटे में”).
घंटा
घंटे
घंटों
